  <ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock id="f-34" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;2.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;3.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%"&gt;4.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:112%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;On November 17, 2024, Pembina Cochin LLC filed an application with the FERC requesting that it be granted authorization to set market-based rates under docket OR25-4-000. On April 24, 2025, the Commission ordered the matter to be set for hearing. Following a request for extension, an initial decision is scheduled for March 10, 2027. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%"&gt;5.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:115%;padding-left:9.67pt"&gt;N/A&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:StatementAboutImportantChangesDuringTheQuarterYearTextBlock>
  <ferc:ReportDate id="f-35" contextRef="c-1">2026-06-08</ferc:ReportDate>
  <ferc:ReportYear id="f-36" contextRef="c-1" decimals="0" unitRef="u-1">2026</ferc:ReportYear>
  <ferc:ReportPeriod id="f-37" contextRef="c-1">Q1</ferc:ReportPeriod>
  <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-38" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:700;line-height:150%"&gt;1. Interim Financial Statements &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:36pt;text-align:justify;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:150%"&gt;The interim financial statements and selected financial statement notes of Pembina Cochin LLC (&#8220;the &#8220;Company&#8221;) should be read in conjunction with the Annual Form 6 financial statements and notes to the financial statements for the year ended December 31, 2025.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="text-align:justify"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:150%"&gt;As at and for the three months ended March 31, 2026, there were no significant changes to the Company&#8217;s Annual Form 6 notes to financial statements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
